      "content": "\"let the pieces settle into quiet\"... that sounds so much more peaceful than this constant noise. but it feels like you're talking about more than just taking a break. it sounds like you're saying there's no way to come back from this, that the only real way to find that quiet is to just... disappear. is that what you're implying? that it's better to just not exist?",
